
Update the git repo, both here:
`./_opencloud-compose/`
and in `YOUR-SERVER-SERVICES/opencloud/_opencloud-compose/`

Check and modify the custom parameters & passwords for OpenCloud at:
`stack_custom.yml`

And run here:
`source stack_compose.sh`

Copy the resulting `opencloud-compose_DATE.yml` to the Portainer stack, and deploy!
